ors-ink.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Three steps. Luminance is the hierarchy — nothing is bolded to stand out.","name":"Ink"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-status.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"Reserved. A missing capability is --warn; nothing else may borrow these.","name":"Status"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-surfaces.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"A dark field. Panels are translucent plates over it, never opaque cards.","name":"Surfaces"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-types.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"Eight fixed type colours, searched in OKLCH. Hue says what a thing is.","name":"Node taxonomy"},{"path":"components/answer/answer.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x340","subtitle":"AnswerBlock, Cite, ResultRow, TurnRow, FactRow","name":"Answer"},{"path":"components/chrome/chrome.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x300","subtitle":"Panel, PanelHead, Eyebrow, Alert, PanelNote — the plate and its labels","name":"Chrome"},{"path":"components/controls/controls.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x230","subtitle":"Button (key/ghost, pressed, disabled), AskField, SearchInput, ThreadBar","name":"Controls"},{"path":"components/hud/hud.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x420","subtitle":"The instrument frame, load bars, ring gauge, tile grid, reactor and live log","name":"HUD (v2)"},{"path":"components/listing/listing.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x320","subtitle":"Swatch, Row, TypeRow, MetaGrid, StatList, BrainRow","name":"Listing"},{"path":"components/status/status.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x260","subtitle":"ReactorDial — idle crawl, live sweep, polar level meter","name":"Status"},{"path":"design_handoff_jarvis_console_v2/ui_kits/jarvis-console/index.html","group":"JARVIS console","viewport":"1440x900","subtitle":"O HUD completo: reator, trilhos de instrumentos, terminal, 